your business in many cases.

00:12:13.510 --> 00:12:18.580
And as you can see, VMware
Engine solves these problems.

00:12:18.580 --> 00:12:22.030
The ease of migration,
there's no change to your VM

00:12:22.030 --> 00:12:24.220
or your app required.

00:12:24.220 --> 00:12:26.920
You can migrate those
